1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Sample course: VIVA's own Transformers notes,
written for this demo.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:15,000
VIVA gives you an oral exam on your own lecture notes.
It asks out loud, checks each answer against your pages,
and tells you what to revise tomorrow.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:30,000
This is the sample course: twelve passages
over pages four to twenty-four.
One click and the examiner is on.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
[EXAMINER, from the transcript of the take:
You're being examined. Tell me what you want
to be asked on, and I'll start there.]

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Examine me on self-attention.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,000
[EXAMINER: the question about self-attention,
exact words from the take]

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Every token compares itself with every other token.
The scores go through a softmax into weights,
and the output is a weighted average of the value vectors.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:15,000
